{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29156","headline":"寄献三川守刘公 二 · 许浑","name":"寄献三川守刘公 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半年三度转蓬居，锦帐心阑羡隼旟。\n老去自惊秦塞鴈，病来先忆楚江鱼。\n长闻季氏千金诺，更望刘公一纸书。\n春雪未晴春酒贵，莫教愁杀马相如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}